01:49:50.180 --> 01:49:51.450
the leaders will follow.

01:49:51.800 --> 01:49:52.480
They'll have to.

01:49:52.980 --> 01:49:56.540
And it isn't about overthrowing the Pentagon, it's about leaving it by.

01:50:01.820 --> 01:50:06.160
My goal when I started this was to make this so that I wasn't important at all in it,

01:50:06.220 --> 01:50:08.380
that there would be enough people that they'd go on without me.

01:50:08.920 --> 01:50:11.180
And that way, it doesn't matter if I drop dead.

01:50:11.980 --> 01:50:13.840
The future is here already.

01:50:14.340 --> 01:50:15.460
The technologies are here.

01:50:16.160 --> 01:50:17.360
Contact is happening.

01:50:17.920 --> 01:50:23.990
And if we come together as a people, what we're going to find is that all of us working together

01:50:23.990 --> 01:50:28.120
are going to be able to create a world that is amazing.

01:50:28.730 --> 01:50:29.970
If every single one of us...

01:50:30.000 --> 01:50:35.620
of us, told everyone we know that we're being visited by intelligent life, that the sciences

01:50:35.620 --> 01:50:41.500
are here to give us a new civilization. We're liberated from that macroeconomic slavery.

01:50:42.070 --> 01:50:47.670
This is the destiny of humanity. Thank you very much. God bless you all.

01:51:00.600 --> 01:51:01.100
Thank you.

01:51:09.760 --> 01:51:11.940
What we've come to learn is this.

01:51:13.080 --> 01:51:16.720
We are standing at the precipice of a new age.

01:51:17.810 --> 01:51:21.640
There is power in the many, but only when they're acting as one.

01:51:22.810 --> 01:51:24.310
That's when resonance happens.

01:51:25.310 --> 01:51:29.970
Whether joining together as a responsible citizenry against the forces standing...

01:51:30.190 --> 01:51:40.170
Provide us, joining consciousness to unite with the beings who are prepared to communicate with us.

01:51:48.050 --> 01:51:56.240
In order to succeed in this endeavor called life, we must come together as one.

01:54:02.652 --> 01:54:03.572
Gosh, I am.

